
=== RESTART MODES: what actually ends the residue ===
  columns: socket/read/induced-actuation

  pre-deletion control     1/1/1
  after deletion           1/1/1

  issuing homeassistant.restart (the in-UI action)...
  after CORE restart       0/0/0   (socket dead: ConnectionClosedOK)

  issuing docker restart (the arm already in the paper)...
  after CONTAINER restart  0/0/0   (socket dead: ConnectionClosedOK)

  VERDICT: the in-UI restart ENDS the residue. The remedy is one the
